('Feature_01_Stock_Intraday', 'ticker', 'ticker x timeframe (5m, 15m, 1h, 4h) x bar_time', 'Identity', 'Exact IDX stock ticker of the bar (never the universe index).', 'Direct copy of price_stock_idx_intraday.ticker; validate_stock_feature_identity refuses an index.', 'price_stock_idx_intraday', 'price_stock_idx_intraday: ticker, timeframe, bar_time, session_date, open, high, low, close, volume (stocks only; IDX_Stock_Universe "Security Type" index excluded)', '1 source bar', '1 source bar', 'code', 'Never NULL.', 'idx-intraday-cron feature step (intraday_feature_queue) after each daily load; once by the backfill job', 'The 120 bars before the first changed bar are read as context, so each written bar equals a full-history calculation; rows are written from that bar to the end of the series.', 'v1', true, 'IDENTITY', ARRAY['COUNT', 'COUNT_DISTINCT']::text[], 'NOT_APPLICABLE', true, true, 'Close-of-bar value, loaded once a day after the session close plus Equity_Market_Schedule.finality_delay_minutes; not available intraday in real time and not exposed to the AI yet.', false, 'Intraday bars are split-adjusted as TradingView gives them at load time; a series whose whole stored scale changed is not written until rescaled (loader verdict SCALE_CHANGED). Session completeness: join price_stock_idx_intraday_quality on (timeframe, session_date).', 'Identifies the security; not a ranking value.', 'Join and filter by exact ticker.', 'Do not expect IHSG here: index intraday features are not built yet (user D4, 2026-10-31).', 'CALCULATION_VERIFIED', ARRAY['database/migrations/20261031_004_intraday_features.sql', 'verification/intraday_features/README.md', 'apps/idx-price-cron/intraday_features.py', 'apps/idx-price-cron/test_intraday_features.py']::text[]),
